# Git mailmap: normalises contributor identities.
#
# This repository is derived from dnd-ed/pythonshenanigans. Contributors there
# commit under two identities with different addresses; both are mapped to the
# canonical identity below.
#
# `git log --format=%aN/%aE` (and therefore .github/scripts/add_authors.js)
# respects this file.
#
# Format: Proper Name <proper@email> Commit Name <commit@email>

akinari (aki) <pts@itzdanti.dev> itzdanti <contact@itzdanti.dev>
akinari (aki) <pts@itzdanti.dev> akinari (aki) <contact@itzdanti.dev>
